    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just a feeling though. i see it in my moms face when i walk into a room, and the way my friends go quiet when i text. it's like they're all just waiting for me to realize i'm the problem. i just want them to be able to breathe again without worrying about me or how i'm doing. i feel like if i could just stop being an issue for them, everything would finally be peaceful.",
